# Local Project Override

Use this file as a template for project-specific guidance that should not live in cursor-harness.

- Copy to `.cursor/rules/<your-project>-local.mdc` in the consumer repo
- Do not name it the same as a harness-managed rule (e.g. avoid `core-principles.mdc`,
  `doc-routing.mdc`, `code-quality.mdc`, `testing.mdc`, `security-basics.mdc`)
- Keep it short and actionable
- Put stack-specific conventions here (frameworks, folder layout, deploy scripts)
